cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its findings, please cite both the software and the thesis below."
title: "BWM-Distill-PointPillars: Beam-Wise Mixing Consistency for BEV Feature Distillation"
abstract: >-
  Training-time-only constraints that transfer a CenterPoint-pillar BEV encoder
  into a stock PointPillars detector on nuScenes. Combines L2-normalized BEV
  feature distillation with a beam-wise point-cloud mixing consistency
  regularizer, improving mAP and NDS at zero inference cost.
type: software
license: MIT
